OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few,
OL,6,Fscattered showers around. These
OL,7,Fremaining light and fading through the
OL,8,Fearly hours. Otherwise, clear spells.
OL,9,FWinds easing overnight, feeling
OL,10,Fchillier than last night, particularly
OL,11,Falong southern coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA bright start for most,
OL,14,Fturning increasingly cloudy from the
OL,15,Fwest with rain to follow in the
OL,16,Fevening. Feeling markedly cooler than
OL,17,Fof late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
