OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloud
OL,6,Fthickening into Friday with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain, heavy at times with blustery
OL,8,Fwinds. Rain clearing by Saturday with
OL,9,Fsunny spells and showers to follow.
OL,10,FMore settled on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
